#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:5
#: a217dd95ce9548b49b2663c45ceabd78
msgid "Aggressive Rate Loop Tuning"
msgstr "激进的速率环调参"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:7
#: de8364835fed484db5a38acb49b28183
msgid ""
"Normally, the attitude rate PID controllers update at the "
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>`, the main loop speed and noise "
"filtering at half the loop rate. This means that PID rate error corrections "
"can happen only at 1/loop rate. For 400hz, this is 2.5ms. In ArduCopter 4.7 "
"and later, it is possible to run the PID attitude rates closer to the rate "
"at which the gyros provide measurements, which can be up to 4KHz, resulting "
"in 2.5uS rate corrections. Tuning is more sensitive and complex, but for "
"aerobatic applications on vehicles with large thrust to inertia ratios (ie "
"very agile) could yield much more precise and responsive control."
msgstr ""
"通常，姿态速率 PID 控制器以主循环速率 :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` "
"更新，噪声滤波以循环速率的一半运行。这意味着 PID 速率误差修正只能以 1/循环速率的间隔进行。对于 400hz，即 2.5ms。在 "
"ArduCopter 4.7 及更高版本中，PID 姿态速率环可以更接近陀螺仪提供测量的速率运行（最高可达 4KHz），从而实现 2.5uS "
"的速率修正。调参会更敏感、更复杂，但对于推力惯量比很大（即非常敏捷）的飞行器上的特技应用，可获得更精确、更灵敏的控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:9
#: 308ab66d5699461d8e7f9224d5327d77
msgid ""
"this is much more computationally intensive, resulting in higher CPU loads. "
"On H7 based autopilots it is acceptable, but F4 based autopilots might not "
"be able to sustain this increased load."
msgstr "这在计算上开销大得多，会导致更高的 CPU 负载。基于 H7 的飞控可以接受，但基于 F4 的飞控可能无法承受这一增加的负载。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:11
#: e3c22c08d8f3481e9d80642a193ee579
msgid ""
"To setup running the PID rate loops closer to the higher gyro sampling "
"rates, rather than the :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>`:"
msgstr ""
"若要让 PID 速率环以更接近陀螺仪较高采样率（而非 "
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>`）的速率运行，设置如下："

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:14
#: f7ac91ee57bf4c73ac68d1d94b7c333d
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:15
#: c015c15d8bd24d83892ed44474ea2981
msgid ""
"There are only two new settings for enabling fast rate attitude, but these "
"have an effect on several other settings:"
msgstr "启用快速姿态速率只有两个新设置，但它们会影响其他若干设置："

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:17
#: 092b5f80293943fa8b6db956e95072a2
msgid ":ref:`FSTRATE_ENABLE<FSTRATE_ENABLE>`:"
msgstr ":ref:`FSTRATE_ENABLE<FSTRATE_ENABLE>`："

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:18
#: 489fb5e83f164f9380f67a987a0a52f0
msgid "0: Disables this feature."
msgstr "0：禁用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:19
#: 6df6d326b3da4a1a9b6d245e2f9ee6b7
msgid ""
"1: Enable dynamic fast rate. On high CPU loading (as determined by either "
"the main loop being slow or the gyro sample queue filling up) the rate will "
"be reduced to an integer divisor of the gyro data rate until the CPU "
"stabilizes. This is the safest way of trying the support."
msgstr ""
"1：启用动态快速速率。当 CPU 负载较高时（由主循环变慢或陀螺仪采样队列填满来判定），速率会降至陀螺仪数据速率的整数分频，直到 CPU "
"稳定。这是尝试该功能最安全的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:20
#: 3f1c5089fbbe45b483ed63e8580df446
msgid ""
"2: Enable dynamic fast rate, but fix to the requested rate on arming. This "
"allows un-armed operations such as log download to proceed effectively. Note"
" that you must be sure that you have sufficient CPU to enable this option or"
" control can be compromised."
msgstr ""
"2：启用动态快速速率，但在解锁时固定为所请求的速率。这样日志下载等未解锁状态下的操作可以高效进行。注意，必须确保 CPU "
"足够才可启用此选项，否则控制可能受到影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:21
#: 0c60e7792eba4680ba278ba078defa8b
msgid ""
"3: Enable fixed fast rate. This is useful for testing but not usually used."
msgstr "3：启用固定快速速率。适用于测试，通常不使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:23
#: 1701feaa7c12481c8d9c86137d4b9b07
msgid ""
":ref:`FSTRATE_DIV<FSTRATE_DIV>`: this defaults to 1 and represents the "
"minimum fast rate gyro divisor. So a value of 2 will yield a rate loop of "
"gyro rate / 2 (:ref:`INS_GYRO_RATE<INS_GYRO_RATE>` / 2). This allows a fixed"
" fast rate that is lower than the gyro rate. This parameter is can be "
"modified in-flight."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FSTRATE_DIV<FSTRATE_DIV>`：默认为 1，表示最小的快速速率陀螺仪分频系数。因此值为 2 时，速率环为陀螺仪速率 / "
"2（:ref:`INS_GYRO_RATE<INS_GYRO_RATE>` / 2）。这允许固定快速速率低于陀螺仪速率。该参数可在飞行中修改。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:25
#: 6c9a2de145b14bf39cb49a5336e3e328
msgid ""
"The easiest way to try this feature is to set "
":ref:`FSTRATE_ENABLE<FSTRATE_ENABLE>` = 1 (Dynamic rate). If your flight "
"controller is struggling it will reduce the attitude loop rate until "
"normality is restored. :ref:`FSTRATE_ENABLE<FSTRATE_ENABLE>` = 2 (Fixed "
"Rate) is not recommended until you have seen reasonable performance with "
"dynamic rates."
msgstr ""
"尝试此功能最简单的方法是设置 :ref:`FSTRATE_ENABLE<FSTRATE_ENABLE>` = "
"1（动态速率）。如果飞控吃力，它会降低姿态环速率直至恢复正常。在动态速率下观察到合理的性能之前，不建议使用 "
":ref:`FSTRATE_ENABLE<FSTRATE_ENABLE>` = 2（固定速率）。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:27
#: 083a5021ce8240a5bd225ae2caef0388
msgid ""
"One way to gain more CPU is to switch off additional IMUs using "
":ref:`INS_ENABLE_MASK<INS_ENABLE_MASK>` or reduce "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_RATE<INS_GYRO_RATE>`. The main CPU load is from the INS and "
"attitude control threads."
msgstr ""
"获得更多 CPU 的一种方法是通过 :ref:`INS_ENABLE_MASK<INS_ENABLE_MASK>` 关闭多余的 IMU，或降低 "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_RATE<INS_GYRO_RATE>`。主要的 CPU 负载来自 INS 和姿态控制线程。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:29
#: 2c30cf52dbf346a4ab469a9baa7078be
msgid "When this feature is enabled, several other settings are affected:"
msgstr "启用此功能后，其他若干设置会受到影响："

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:31
#: a7f37181c907459297528f08c5463c2f
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO_DSHOT_RATE<SERVO_DSHOT_RATE>` - this represents a multiplier of "
"the main loop rate to output to the motors. When the fast rate loop is "
"enabled this is normally set to 1, however if the calculated rate will not "
"exceed the gyro rate, higher values are allowed. For instance if "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_RATE<INS_GYRO_RATE>` = 2(4KHz) and "
":ref:`FSTRATE_DIV<FSTRATE_DIV>` = 4 (1KHz)then values of "
":ref:`SERVO_DSHOT_RATE<SERVO_DSHOT_RATE>` up to 4(4x loop rate) are allowed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO_DSHOT_RATE<SERVO_DSHOT_RATE>` - 表示输出到电机时相对主循环速率的倍数。启用快速速率环时通常设为 "
"1，但只要计算出的速率不超过陀螺仪速率，也允许更高的值。例如当 :ref:`INS_GYRO_RATE<INS_GYRO_RATE>` = "
"2（4KHz）且 :ref:`FSTRATE_DIV<FSTRATE_DIV>` = "
"4（1KHz）时，:ref:`SERVO_DSHOT_RATE<SERVO_DSHOT_RATE>` 的值最高允许到 4（4 倍循环速率）。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:32
#: 985a30087fee416db6c0e3d493485931
msgid ""
"Fast attitude and PID logging enabled in :ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` - "
"setting these bits usually logs at the main loop rate, however if fast "
"attitude is enabled these will be logged at the minimum of the fast attitude"
" rate and 1kHz"
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` 中启用的快速姿态与 PID 日志 - "
"设置这些位通常按主循环速率记录日志，但若启用了快速姿态，则按快速姿态速率与 1kHz 二者的较小值记录"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:33
#: b6c2f7559ca04fbd8a84d2a2f65a3bdd
msgid ""
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` - since all the heavy lifting of "
"attitude control is being done in a separate thread, "
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` can be run at normal values - for "
"instance 400Hz or even less."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` - "
"由于姿态控制的繁重工作在单独的线程中完成，:ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` 可按正常值运行 - 例如 "
"400Hz 甚至更低。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:36
#: 095681aae56e45e39602b4bc4aacfdc0
msgid "Tuning Setup"
msgstr "调参设置"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:37
#: 52ae995a8cb3481a89eadded22a0a19e
msgid ""
"Its extremely important that the :ref:`Notch filtering <common-imu-notch-"
"filtering>` be setup as well as the :ref:`tuning-process-instructions` be "
"followed before tuning with this feature enabled."
msgstr ""
"在启用此功能进行调参之前，必须先设置好 :ref:`陷波滤波 <common-imu-notch-filtering>` 并遵循 "
":ref:`tuning-process-instructions`，这一点极其重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:39
#: 16f3f5bda87c4133b3f11727f7bcad56
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` - as high as you can get without "
"cooking your motors. Often copters have resonance around 120Hz so it is hard"
" to get higher than this without notching out frame resonance."
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` - 在不烧坏电机的前提下设得尽可能高。多旋翼通常在 120Hz "
"附近存在共振，因此若不通过陷波滤除机架共振，很难高于该值。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:40
#: 4ca46cfa334f49c69c69ad181fc99f24
msgid ""
"each axis' ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FLTD`` should be "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>`/2 on roll and pitch and "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>`/4 on yaw. This is because D is more "
"active, lets more noise through and is more likely to cook your motors. "
"Setting it above 0.75 * :ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` is not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"每个轴的 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FLTD`` 在横滚和俯仰上应为 "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>`/2，在偏航上应为 "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>`/4。这是因为 D "
"项更活跃，会让更多噪声通过，更容易烧坏电机。不建议将其设为高于 0.75 * "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/high-loop-rate-tuning.rst:41
#: f6b9ea8f28fd4ac181b81a6153819f26
msgid ""
"each axis' ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FLTT`` should be at the highest rate you want the "
"EKF or your fingers to control the copter. Values of 30Hz should be fine, "
"but higher has diminishing returns but does not affect the tune."
msgstr ""
"每个轴的 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FLTT`` 应设为你希望 EKF 或你的手指控制飞行器的最高速率。设为 30Hz "
"应该足够，更高的值收益递减，但不影响调参结果。"
